@startuml
title State machine for Microwave Oven

state Idle as Idle
Idle : entry/Display current time
Idle : do/Wait for user input

state Cooking as Cooking
Cooking : entry/Cooking started
Cooking : do/Cooking in progress

state Cancelled as Cancelled
Cancelled : entry/Cooking cancelled
Cancelled : do/Return to idle state

state DoorOpen as DoorOpen
DoorOpen : entry/Door opened during cooking
DoorOpen : do/Stop cooking immediately

state InvalidInput as InvalidInput
InvalidInput : entry/Invalid input detected
InvalidInput : do/Display error message and return to idle state

Idle --> Cooking : user selects power level and enters cooking time
Cooking --> Cancelled : user cancels cooking process
Cooking --> DoorOpen : door opened during cooking
DoorOpen --> Idle : stop cooking immediately
Cancelled --> Idle : return to idle state
InvalidInput --> Idle : display error message and return to idle state

@enduml
